msgid "上一采样帧：暂停动作与物理，精确检查姿势。到达开头后保持首帧。"
msgstr "Previous sampled frame: pauses motion and physics to inspect the pose. Stops at the first frame."

#. Key:	ImportMotion_013
#. SourceLocation:	PluginSrc/Source/Ue5MMDToolsEditor/Private/UI/MMDImportSettingMotion.cpp(122)
#: PluginSrc/Source/Ue5MMDToolsEditor/Private/UI/MMDImportSettingMotion.cpp(122)
msgctxt "Ue5MMDToolsUI,ImportMotion_013"
msgid "拖动定位动作，松开后恢复此前的播放状态。键盘选中时间轴后按 Enter 开始微调，方向键每次移动一采样帧，再按 Enter 结束。"
msgstr "Drag to seek; releasing restores the previous playback state. Focus the timeline and press Enter to fine-tune, arrow keys step one sampled frame, Enter again to finish."

#. Key:	ImportMotion_014
#. SourceLocation:	PluginSrc/Source/Ue5MMDToolsEditor/Private/UI/MMDImportSettingMotion.cpp(133)
#: PluginSrc/Source/Ue5MMDToolsEditor/Private/UI/MMDImportSettingMotion.cpp(133)
