msgstr "Next sampled frame: pauses motion and physics to inspect the pose. Stops at the last frame without looping."

#. Key:	ImportMotion_016
#. SourceLocation:	PluginSrc/Source/Ue5MMDToolsEditor/Private/UI/MMDImportSettingMotion.cpp(146)
#: PluginSrc/Source/Ue5MMDToolsEditor/Private/UI/MMDImportSettingMotion.cpp(146)
